Date: Sun, 13 Sep 2026 11:23:43 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] Sync gameplay fixes from upstream N0zoM1z0/th08
 (50077aca..a45e99fb)

Ported by hand from port/portable-64bit; a plain cherry-pick conflicts because the
port guards the same regions with TH08_PORTABLE_NATIVE_LAYOUT and does not carry the
byte-exactness configs (config/match-units.toml, scripts/*).

- ItemManager: item auto-collection requires full power (upstream 7148a76).
  Fixes the port's "items auto-attracted below max power" known issue.
- Background: draw gates use Gui::IsStageFinished, not IsDialoguePresent
  (upstream af72ca9, runtime ledger RT-006). Fixes the black background behind
  pre-boss dialogue and the accumulated player/portrait trails.
- Gui: CopyEnemyNameTexture reads sprites from frontAnm (33 sprites) instead of
  the six-sprite stgNtxt.anm, which it indexed at 16..27 (upstream 63256e0, RT-002).
- BulletManager / EffectManager / Player / EclExIns: four relocated floating
  literals restored to the target values (upstream a393f40): laser-cancel item
  split step 1.0 -> 32.0, effect directional offset +0.0 -> +1.0, respawn
  animation divisor 60.0 -> 30.0, narrow mirror-barrier warp ratio branches
  swapped back to the target ownership.
